<view class="profile">
  <view class="avatar">😋</view>
  <view class="info">
    <view class="role">{{user.role === 'merchant' ? '商家' : '顾客'}}</view>
    <view class="openid">账号尾号:{{openidTail || '...'}}</view>
  </view>
</view>

<view class="card menu" wx:if="{{user.role === 'merchant'}}">
  <view class="menu-item" bindtap="goMerchant">
    <text>🏪 商家中心</text>
    <text class="arrow">›</text>
  </view>
  <view class="menu-item" bindtap="onSeed">
    <text>🍽️ 初始化菜单数据</text>
    <text class="arrow">›</text>
  </view>
</view>

<view class="card tips">
  <view class="tips-title">使用说明</view>
  <view class="tip">1. 顾客扫桌码或手动选桌号点餐</view>
  <view class="tip">2. 模拟支付后商家接单出餐</view>
  <view class="tip">3. 商家账号在云数据库 users 中置 role=merchant(详见 README)</view>
</view>
